<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-CHAMPIONS TROPHY STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings at the end of the</p>
<p>round-robin league in the Champions Trophy hockey tournament on</p>
<p>Friday (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>goals against and points):</p>
<p> Netherlands	 5  3  2  0  10   3  11</p>
<p> Pakistan	    5  3  1  1  13  10  10</p>
<p> Germany	     5  3  0  2  12  11   9</p>
<p> India		 5  2  1  2  10   7   7</p>
<p> Australia	   5  0  2  3   6  12   2</p>
<p> Spain		 5  0  2  3   6  14   2</p>
</text>
